                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.512/459: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in China</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-12-09T17:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 9,
                                1926—5 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>293. Your telegram 607, December 9, 1 A.M. This Government would make no
                    objection to levy of surtax for purposes mentioned.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
